
P_TTY_NEWENV
***************


NAME
====

   P_TTY_NEWENV                         "tty_newenv"


DEFINIERT IN
============

   /secure/telnetneg.h


BESCHREIBUNG
============

   Ein Mapping, welches NEWENV Variable enthält:

   NEWENV_CHARSET              Character set
   NEWENV_CLIENT_NAME          Name of the client
   NEWENV_CLIENT_VERSION       Version of the client
   NEWENV_IPADDRESS            The client's IP address
   NEWENV_MTTS                 bitvector
   NEWENV_TERMINAL_TYPE        name


SIEHE AUCH
==========

   P_TTY_COLS, P_TTY_ROWS, P_TTY_SHOW, P_TTY_TYPE, P_TTY_MTTS_MASK
